  "_areaLayerComment": "🏛️ Dependency direction. `repo-wide` code (the root router, root manifests) and `framework` code may be depended UPON by an implementation, never the reverse: deleting an `implementation` area must leave every `repo-wide` and `framework` file correct and up to date. An implementation-specific rule therefore belongs in that implementation's own 📜️script.ts, which the policy plugin already discovers, not in the root router. Enforced by the parser-backed canonical-architecture graph gate without reference-count baselines or generated-banner exemptions.",
